## 📊 Detection Logic Templates

### SIEM Query Examples (Splunk SPL)

#### Network Scanning Activity Detection
```splunk
index=network 
src_ip NOT IN [list of authorized_scanners]
AND (command: nmap OR command: masscan)
| stats count by src_ip, dest_ip
| where count > 10
```

#### Port Scan Detection
```splunk
index=firewall 
action="DENY" 
AND port_scan_detected=true
| stats count by src_ip, dest_port
| where count > 5
```

#### DNS Zone Transfer Attempts
```splunk
index=dns 
query_type="AXFR"
AND client_ip NOT IN [list of authorized_dns_admins]
| stats count by client_ip, domain_name
```

